graph LR
    ODHObs[odh-observability Operator]

    %% Prerequisite operators (capability-gated)
    ODHObs -->|"MonitoringStack, ThanosQuerier, Perses"| COO["Cluster Observability Operator 1.5.x"]
    ODHObs -->|TempoMonolithic / TempoStack| TempoOp[Tempo Operator]
    ODHObs -->|OpenTelemetryCollector, Instrumentation| OTelOp[OpenTelemetry Operator]
    ODHObs -->|LokiStack| LokiOp[Loki Operator]
    ODHObs -->|"ClusterLogForwarder (v6)"| CLO[Cluster Logging Operator]
    ODHObs -->|webhook + TargetAllocator certs| CertManager[cert-manager]
    ODHObs -->|prerequisite detection| OLM["OLM v0/v1"]
    ODHObs -.->|serving certs| ServiceCA[OpenShift service-ca]
    ODHObs -.->|label mutation on monitors| PromOp["Prometheus Operator CRDs<br/>monitoring.coreos.com"]

    %% Go libraries
    ODHObs -->|framework| CR["controller-runtime v0.25.2"]
    ODHObs -->|client| ClientGo["client-go v0.37.1"]
    ODHObs -->|"APIServer TLS, Routes"| OSAPI[openshift/api]
    ODHObs -->|"SSA deployer, TLS, FIPS"| PlatUtil["odh-platform-utilities v0.5.0"]
    ODHObs -->|custom metrics| PromClient["prometheus/client_golang v1.24.0"]

    %% Internal ODH
    PlatformOp["rhods-operator / opendatahub-operator"] -->|ModuleHandler, DSCI spec.monitoring| ODHObs
    ODHObs -->|reads InferenceServices, monitors| KServe[KServe]
    MaaS["Models-as-a-Service"] -->|OTLP usage logs| ODHObs
    ODHObs -->|trace export RBAC| MLflow[MLflow]
    Dashboard[odh-dashboard] -->|consumes Perses datasources| ODHObs
    ODHObs -->|proxy sidecar image| KRP[odh-kube-rbac-proxy]

    %% External services
    ODHObs -->|API server| K8sAPI[Kubernetes API]
    ODHObs -->|Perses datasource upstream| OCPThanos["OpenShift Thanos :9091/:9092"]
    ODHObs -->|Tempo / Loki backends| ObjStore["S3 / GCS"]

